["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">一度</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いちど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">一次；一回；一遍；暂时；片刻；一时；一度；一个音程</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144317\"><ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>一度<rp>(</rp><rt>いちど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しか<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一个活在世上,只有一个人</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">一生懸命</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いっしょうけんめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拼命；竭尽全力；全力以赴；不遗余力；急切地；拼死地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193301\">もっと<ruby>一生懸命<rp>(</rp><rt>いっしょうけんめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すべきだったのに。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你应该努力工作。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いっぱい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">一杯；一玻璃杯；一碗；满满一杯；满满一碗；满满一勺；一杯（酒）；满的；充满的；满溢的；拥挤的；挤满的；充分地；满满地；最大限度地；尽可能地；很多；大量；许多；全部的……；整个的……；一只（乌贼、章鱼、螃蟹等）；一艘（船）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223142\">このボトルに<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をいっぱい<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてください。</span><spa