<rp>)</rp></ruby>はむしろ<ruby>田舎<rp>(</rp><rt>いなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みたい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我宁愿一个人住在乡下</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">祈る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いのる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">祈祷；祈求；念祷文；做祷告；祈愿；希望；期盼</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140573\"><ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>はや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くよくなられるように<ruby>祈<rp>(</rp><rt>いの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">希望你尽快康复</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いらっしゃる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">来；去；在（某处）；正在做；在做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">植える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">种植；培育；栽培；插入；移植；植入；排版；接种（如传染性病原体）；灌输（思想、价值观等）；培养</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154971\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>庭<rp>(</rp><rt>にわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にバラを<ruby>植<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在花园里种了玫瑰</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うかがう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拜访；登门；到访；侍奉；询问；请教；打听；听说；被告知；祈求神谕；请示上司；向（剧场等大批观众）致辞；向众人讲话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137976\"><ruby>体重<rp>(</rp><rt>たいじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をおうかがいしてもよろしいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我能问你你的体重是多少吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">受付</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うけつけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接待处；前台；接待员；咨询员；受理；接收</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148365\"><ruby>受付<rp>(</rp><rt>うけつけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>入院<rp>(</rp><rt>にゅういん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>手続<rp>(</rp><rt>てつづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きをしてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">您必须在前台填写入院申请。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">受ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接收；获得；接住；接球；受到（风吹、浪打、日晒等）；迎着（风浪）；沐浴（阳光）；承受（损害）；遭受（损失）；受（伤）；感受（影响）；接受（手术等）；参加（考试）；应（战）；被赋予；天生具有（生命、才能等）；觉得有趣；感到好笑；被逗乐；继承；传承；出身于；面向；朝向（南方等）；受…修饰；赎回；取回（当物等）；受欢迎；流行；叫座</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85306\"><ruby>病気<rp>(</rp><rt>びょうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なので<ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けられません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能参加考试 因为我病了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うごく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">移动；摇晃；转移；摆动；运转；运行；开动；工作；采取行动；行动；起身行动；感动；受影响；被感染；改变；变化；波动；摇摆；被调动；被转移</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195415\">まだ<ruby>動<rp>(</rp><rt>うご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くうちに<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってしまわなきゃ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我应该趁它还在运行的时候卖掉它</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うそ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谎言；谎话；虚言；错误；失误；不明智之举；错误决策；不可能！；难以置信！；真的吗？！</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227962\">えっ<ruby>嘘<rp>(</rp><rt>うそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でしょ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哦,我的上帝,我不能相信这一点。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">内部；里面；期间；……之内；趁……时；在……过程中；其中；之间；……里；在……中；处于……状态；内心；想法；感受；我们；我公司；我们机构；家；家庭；配偶；丈夫；妻子；代夫签署；我；我自己；皇宫；宫禁；禁中（古语）；皇帝</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78640\"><ruby>来週<rp>(</rp><rt>らいしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はうちへいらしゃいませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你下周不来看我吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><spa