s=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">写</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">映る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うつる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">映出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">映</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">移る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うつる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">移动到（另一个地方或状态）；转移；变化；调换；传播；蔓延；传染；感染；转移（如注意力）；改变（如兴趣）；渗透；浸入；被（颜色或气味）所染；流逝；经过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193349\">もっとお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があれば<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きな<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>移<rp>(</rp><rt>うつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるのにな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果我有更多的钱, 我可以搬到一个更大的房子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">腕</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うで</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">臂；手臂；能力；技能；才能；本领；力量；体力</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225274\">けがをした<ruby>腕<rp>(</rp><rt>うで</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\